# 中频词汇 List08
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024恋练有词
# 描述: 中频词汇List08核心词汇

{{glory}}{/ˈɡlɔːri/}{光荣；荣誉}{The team celebrated their moment of glory.}}
{{gorgeous}}{/ˈɡɔːdʒəs/}{华丽的；极好的}{The view from the mountaintop was absolutely gorgeous.}}
{{govern}}{/ˈɡʌvən/}{统治；管理}{The country is governed by a democratic parliament.}}
{{grace}}{/ɡreɪs/}{优雅；恩惠}{She moved with grace and confidence on stage.}}
{{gradual}}{/ˈɡrædʒuəl/}{逐渐的；渐进的}{There has been a gradual improvement in air quality.}}
{{grant}}{/ɡrɑːnt/}{授予；拨款；助学金}{The foundation granted $2 million to the research center.}}
{{grasp}}{/ɡrɑːsp/}{抓住；理解}{The concept is difficult to grasp at first.}}
{{gratitude}}{/ˈɡrætɪtjuːd/}{感激；感谢}{She expressed her gratitude for the support she received.}}
{{grave}}{/ɡreɪv/}{严重的；坟墓}{The situation poses a grave threat to public health.}}
{{grieve}}{/ɡriːv/}{悲伤；哀悼}{The community grieved the loss of a beloved teacher.}}
{{gross}}{/ɡrəʊs/}{总的；严重的}{The gross revenue exceeded $10 billion last year.}}
{{guarantee}}{/ˌɡærənˈtiː/}{保证；担保}{No investment can guarantee a profit.}}
{{guilty}}{/ˈɡɪlti/}{有罪的；内疚的}{The jury found the defendant guilty of fraud.}}
{{halt}}{/hɔːlt/}{停止；暂停}{Production was halted due to a supply shortage.}}
{{handful}}{/ˈhændfʊl/}{一把；少量}{Only a handful of students passed the exam.}}
{{harmony}}{/ˈhɑːməni/}{和谐；融洽}{The community lives in harmony with nature.}}
{{harsh}}{/hɑːʃ/}{严厉的；恶劣的}{The harsh winter made travel conditions dangerous.}}
{{harvest}}{/ˈhɑːvɪst/}{收获；收割}{Farmers celebrated a bountiful harvest this season.}}
{{hazard}}{/ˈhæzəd/}{危险；风险}{Smoking is a serious health hazard.}}
{{heal}}{/hiːl/}{治愈；愈合}{Time can heal emotional wounds.}}
{{heritage}}{/ˈherɪtɪdʒ/}{遗产；传统}{The country is proud of its rich cultural heritage.}}
{{hesitate}}{/ˈhezɪteɪt/}{犹豫；踌躇}{Do not hesitate to contact us if you need help.}}
{{highlight}}{/ˈhaɪlaɪt/}{突出；亮点}{The report highlights the need for further investment.}}
{{hinder}}{/ˈhɪndər/}{阻碍；妨碍}{Bureaucracy can hinder economic development.}}
{{horizon}}{/həˈraɪzn/}{地平线；视野}{New opportunities are appearing on the horizon.}}
{{hostile}}{/ˈhɒstaɪl/}{敌对的；不友好的}{The hostile environment made negotiations difficult.}}
{{household}}{/ˈhaʊshəʊld/}{家庭；家用的}{The product is found in nearly every household.}}
{{humble}}{/ˈhʌmbl/}{谦虚的；卑微的}{Despite his success, he remained humble and grounded.}}
{{hypothesis}}{/haɪˈpɒθəsɪs/}{假设；假说}{The hypothesis was tested through a series of experiments.}}
{{ideology}}{/ˌaɪdiˈɒlədʒi/}{意识形态；思想体系}{Political ideology shapes policy decisions.}}
